{"id":"wb-1-36","name":"榆林窟","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"榆林窟","text":"榆林窟，为一座位于中国甘肃省瓜州的古代石窟，1961年被列为第一批全国重点文物保护单位。其被当今主流学界认为是敦煌石窟的重要组成部分，与莫高窟并称为姊妹窟。\n榆林窟开凿在榆林河峡谷两岸的断崖上，又称万佛峡，现存洞窟四十三个，其中东崖三十二窟，西崖十一窟。因无史料记载，创建年代无从考证，从洞窟形制及壁画风格推断，当不晚于莫高窟。其历史价值与艺术价值在中国唐至元代的石窟寺中具有重要地位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%A6%86%E6%9E%97%E7%AA%9F","revisionId":94981369,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=94981369","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与所在地一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/344a027218d7060ed2481627.jpg","title":"榆林窟.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E6%A6%86%E6%9E%97%E7%AA%9F.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/5f/%E6%A6%86%E6%9E%97%E7%AA%9F.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Redpipe","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0","caption":"","width":320,"height":214}}